	(text "RC SERVO HEADERS - 6x 1x3 2.54 mm, ALL DNP FOR THE FIRST PROTOTYPE\nPinout (standard RC servo): 1 = Signal (1-2 ms pulse, 3.3 V from FPGA via 1k), 2 = SERVO_V (+V), 3 = GND\nSERVO_V power source NOT decided yet: later jumper to VSYS or feed from a dedicated regulator\n(servo stall current can exceed 1 A each - size the source and copper accordingly).\nR78-R83 1k series resistors are DNP together with the headers (protect FPGA pins from miswired servo leads)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
